Body:

At our best, we honor the authentic in ourselves, in others, and in the world. 

Authenticity is characterized by depth, breadth, connection, duration and coherence. 

In other words, we distinguish between what is authentic, vs. what is shallow, superficial, inaccurate, fragmented and/or transient. 

